<title>RUSSIA: Details of Russia company tax arrears as at June 1.</title>
<headline>Details of Russia company tax arrears as at June 1.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of Russian companies with major tax arrears as of June 1, 1997, according to the State Tax Service.</p>
<p>The amount owed by the listed companies totalled 32.97 trillion roubles ($5.7 billion), up from 32.70 trillion roubles ($5.67 billion) on May 1.</p>
